Changes from 3.0.2 to 3.0.3
===========================

*Added:
- The Elevate pages (elevate, elevation detail, remove elevation) and their left menu in the admin4
  design, built from its shared components: notices, one card per task, data tables, the pager and the
  width control of every admin4 left menu. The left menu is the menu.ini section [Leftmenu_ezfind],
  shown to users with the ezfind/elevate policy, like the top menu tab.
- An American English translation (eng-US) that spells Synchronize and occurred on the Elevate pages.
- The admin4 template test (tests/classes/ezfAdmin4TemplatesTest.php) checks the templates, the
  menu, the toggle state, the names of the icon buttons, the completeness of the German translation and
  the removal guard, without a kernel.

*Updated:
- The German translation covers every administration page, the search pages of the site designs and the
  facet names. The admin search page's messages are translated, so they no longer hide the kernel's
  translation with their English source.
- The preview of existing configurations on admin4 is a toggle button with its state (aria-pressed), in
  a form that posts the preference and returns to the page.
- An Elevate detail page without a page size preference lists 10 configurations instead of raising a
  PHP 8 warning about an undefined array key.
- A confirmed removal of an Elevate configuration needs its search query and its language: without
  them it removes nothing, where it used to remove every configuration of the object. A search query
  with & or quotes is matched with the stored one, however the confirmation posted it, and the
  admin4 confirmation shows it as it was entered.
- The credit line of the search plugin has its current source in the translation files and is
  translated into German; German buttons and search tips follow the kernel's terms.
